 compatible USB-C computers with Thunderbolt video output. Connect PC1 and PC2 through USB-C, connect your HDMI monitor, then press the Select but"]}, "B0HNJF823S": {"rating": 5.0, "reviews": 25, "bullets": ["Bluetooth Calls & Messages Notifications: With a Bluetooth connection, this women's smartwatch lets you easily make and answer calls directly from your wrist—no need to hold your phone all the time. Y", "Comprehensive Health Monitoring: Designed to keep up with your daily health, this smartwatch keeps a close eye on your well-being. It tracks heart rate, blood oxygen, blood pressure, and menstrual cyc", "Fitness Watch with 100+ Sports Modes: The fitness tracker smartwatch fits right into your active lifestyle. It automatically logs your daily steps, distance, and calories burned, so you can see how ac", "Broad Compatibility & Long Battery Life: This reloj inteligente para mujer features a built-in battery with magnetic charging—fully charged in just 2 hours and ready for up to 7-10 days of regular use", "IP68 Waterproof Fitness Tracker: Built to keep up with your busy, active days, this women's smartwatch comes with an IP68 waterproof rating. That means you can wash your hands, sweat it out during wor"]}, "B018ZXEO50": {"rating": 4.6, "reviews": 6703, "bullets": ["Lancôme’s number one lash-conditioning mascara primer glides on smoothly and evenly to create the perfect base layer before mascara. Designed to maximize the look of any mascara, Cils Booster XL helps", "Infused with micro-fibers, Vitamin B5, and Vitamin E, this clump-free lash primer separates and coats each lash evenly from root to tip. Its white formula helps amplify mascara pigment intensity while", "In a consumer test with 103 women using Cils Booster XL with their regular mascara, 93% saw more length, 92% saw more volume, and 85% saw more curl. With continued use, this revitalizing lash primer v", "More than a mascara primer, Cils Booster XL doubles as a luxurious overnight lash mask. Apply to c